  "Written down before the work so that finding them is not back-fitted, and so
   that NOT finding them is a result. The lane already holds two reasons the
   premise may be FALSE, and the checker must decide both from the artifacts
   rather than inherit this list as an answer:
   (i) `each witnessed on a real find over the committed library`. Every witness
   in the F11 family is proved over the PINNED 18-pattern transcription, while
   C559 (slice 1) measured the live futon3 library at 24 snatch patterns and
