   differ in :if-lines/:however-lines). C563 :not-claimed states the pin-vs-live
   divergence `belongs to C500 s3's fixture-pin defect`. A DEFECT IS NOT A
   REGISTERED CHOICE. If this obligation is unmet, it may be unmet and UNGATED.
   (ii) F3's citation blindness. Slice 7 recorded, under NOTED NOT ACTED ON, that
   :find-sorry's sixth arm :amend-the-carrier is priced over the F2 and F4 halves
